 ## How the kanji combine
 
-[刺](../kanji/刺.md) contributes pricking or piercing, and 激 contributes intensity or a strong effect. Together they provide an image of something provoking a response. This is a component-based explanation, not a claim that every stimulus is painful. The reading is シ + ゲキ.
